flowchart LR
    SystemUser([System User])
    Manager([LaPrizza Manager])

    %% Inheritance (Sintaxe corrigida para flowchart)
    Manager -.->|inherits| SystemUser

    subgraph BCK01 [BCK01: User and Authentication Management]
        direction TB
        UC1([UC1: Authenticate User / Login])
        UC2([UC2: Register User])
        UC3([UC3: List Users])
        UC4([UC4: Get User])
        UC5([UC5: Update User])
    end

    SystemUser --> UC1
    Manager --> UC2
    Manager --> UC3
    Manager --> UC4
    Manager --> UC5